# papers/ drop zone
#
# Drop camera-ready submissions here using the naming convention:
#   <submissionID>-<surname>.pdf          (camera-ready PDF)
#   <submissionID>-<surname>-source/      (source directory: .tex, .bib, .bbl, images, or .docx)
#
# Git tracking notes:
#   IGNORED  : *.pdf, *.png, *.jpg, *.eps, *.zip  (see root .gitignore)
#              Add binary files explicitly with `git add -f <file>` only if you need to version them.
#   TRACKED  : *.tex, *.bib, *.bbl, *.docx        (Springer requires source files; commit these normally)
